the User is a set.
this's First is a text.
this's Last is a text.

the FullName is a set.
this's Full is a text.

the UserToFullName is a translator.
this takes a User.
this gives a FullName.
this does...
    the Joined is input's First + " " + input's Last.
    this is ok with a FullName with Full Joined!

the App is a script.

the U is a User with First "Ada", Last "Lovelace".
the F is U as a FullName.
log F's Full.
